cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the source paper for its mathematical results; this citation identifies the incomplete Lean formalization."
title: "Uniform attachment with freezing"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/igor-kortchemski/uniform-attachment-with-freezing"
authors:
  - family-names: Kortchemski
    given-names: Igor
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of the seven main theorems of
  Uniform attachment with freezing, in four audited Challenge/Solution
  interfaces with documented carrier and model qualifications. The main
  interfaces pass the official sandboxed Linux Comparator, Lean's kernel and
  NanoDa. All four full Palomar mechanical preflights passed at the source commit recorded
  in verification/certification/palomar/. Whole-manuscript coverage and registry
  registration remain incomplete.
  Developed with automated proof and statement-audit assistance.
references:
