        given-names: Igor
    notes: "The formalized source is the supplied manuscript attachement-uniforme-1-final.tex, identified by SHA-256 in FORMALIZATION_REPORT.md and omitted from this export. The arXiv URL is a bibliographic link; version equality has not been established."
